<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>tsbg bd cancel2</Major>
    <Description>The Strongest Battlegrounds. Backdashcancel for second skill. Best character to use - hero hunter, the strongest hero, Atomic samurai
Usage: after doing a hook dash u hold S and press button u binded the macro and u will be able to combo extend/end based on skill u use ( if the skill is blockable the chance of getting punished is bigger)
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 31 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 20 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
